<title>BRAZIL: Bovespa sees 296.2 mln real inflow so far in Jan.</title>
<headline>Bovespa sees 296.2 mln real inflow so far in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sao Paulo Stock Exchange (Bovespa) said it registered foreign capital inflows of 296.2 million reais in the first 10 days of January.</p>
<p>Foreign buys amounted to 1.517 billion reais, against foreign sales of 1.221 billion reais.</p>
<p>Last year, foreign capital inflows totalled 3.379 billion reais, the bourse added.</p>
<p>-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511-2485412))</p>
